  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "多媒體通訊",
    "sub_ename": "MULTI-MEDIA COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要講授多媒體信號處理及其傳送技術。所謂多媒體信號包括文字、語音、音訊、影像、視訊及動畫等，藉由數位化可將多媒體信號整合處理、儲存及傳輸。主要內容分為三部分：多媒體信號的表示與基本處理、多媒體信號的壓縮技術及其相關標準、多媒體通訊網路與協定。本課程的主要目標是使學生從整體的角度理解多媒體通訊各單元的基本運作原理與方式。",
    "describe_eh": "This course offers the basic concepts of multimedia technology and the communications principles underlying multimedia networking. The multimedia signals include text, speech, audio, image, video, and animation etc. By representing the multimedia signals in digital form, they can be manipulated, stored, and transmitted in an integrated framework. Three major topics are covered in this course: representation and processing of the multimedia signals, compression methods and standards of the multimedia signals, and communication networks and protocols for transmission of the multimedia signals. The goal of the course is to help students understand each part of the multimedia communications from systems viewpoint.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
